"Tass-ovekondo is the old wizard master of an allegiant desert village on Artona I."
"She can no longer support her village, so its people left her in a Here-to-There."
"She wears gray and silver robes with levitating o'odee tail tendrils at her back."
"She has lost two spouses, and grief has made her healings likelier to fail."
"She gave one of her two bound wands to her retired supervisor Uro-bor."
"Her son Olget-ovekondo wanted to take over the village, but she would not support him."
